# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT SECRETS ONLY (wrangler dev reads .dev.vars automatically).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for local development. NEVER commit .dev.vars.
# For production, use `npx wrangler secret put NAME` instead — Cloudflare stores
# secrets encrypted; they are never visible in the dashboard, in git, or in frontend code.

# One-time token required to create the FIRST administrator at /setup (>= 16 chars).
# Generate your own, e.g.:  openssl rand -hex 24   (or any random string on your phone)
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# Only after written NumberOTP reseller approval — leave unset until then:
# NUMBEROTP_API_KEY=

# Only after a payment provider is selected — leave unset until then:
# PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
